<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- BUU</book>
  <para style="h">REV - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc1">REV - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc2">REV - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc3">REV - BUU</para>
  <para style="mt1">REV - BUU</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Imbe nyi he riwa wa kyawa wawa wa ti riwa Yeso Kristo a nghiran. Izhi a nghiran wa kyawa wa nyi ri wu ritu ran no wa ndu wan no wa kpan wan no wa to kya riwa a ran ban vi ran ari ti. Kristo a no kyawa wa nyi no wa he ri rira ri vren ndu wan Yohana riwa a tru nji ri ndu wan hi ri wu, <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />nga Yohana ka la kongye riwa a to. Rinyi a he tre wan ritu tre riwa a zhu ri Izhi nga kpunji riwa Yeso Kristo a la. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Dindi ti he wa nji riwa a kra mbe nyi, nga dindi ti he wa wawa wa sren ton ri wa tre ri kusi nyi nga wari hu kya riwa wa ngan rimi mbe nyi! Ritu ivi ye hyure riwa wa kyawa wa nyi wa ti.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichi Yohana hi ri wa tra Izhi Tamgban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />A he ame Yohana me ngan mbe nyi ri no wa tra Izhi tamgban riwa wa he ri meme Asiya: Dindi ti nga sisron riwa Izhi no he wa mbi, Izhi riwa a he, Izhi riwa a he nga riwa ari ye, nga zhu ri wu tamgban riwa wa he ri kusi kpanchi wan, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />nga zhu ri Yeso Kristo, ila tre ri kpunji, ri mimilan riwa a tashime ri bubu gru nga riwa wawu nye he rinkon wa chu wa gbungblume.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">A nyime ta, nga ika yii wan rega kpa ta chuwo ri meme ti mbu <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />nga a kɨma ta he kpanchi wa ndu Izhi ki ri tindu ri Izhi wan nga A ti wan. No gbre no he wa Yeso Kristo nga gbengbren riwa a ran kre ran! No he ngamba. <verse eid="REV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Ya, ingye nga ari ye ri shuwulu! Ko nga ri to, ka hu ri wawa wa tɨbu. Inji wawu ri mgbumgblume wa ti shnji sron ritu wan. No he ngamba!<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Bachi Izhi a tre ri, &lt;&lt;Ame nye me he ri mimilan nga me ri he krenkpen,&gt;&gt; Riwa, riwa a he nga riwa ari ye.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana a to Kristo ri wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Ame Yohana, vayi mbi, nga ri wawa wa hu Yeso ame me he kpandu wen rimi vusron ri yaa riwa a ye ri wawa wa he ri kpanchi Izhi. Wa vu wen ka yo ri meme riwa ima kagon wan riwa wa yo ri Batmos ritu me la tre Izhi nga kpunji riwa Yeso a ye la. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Chachu vi ri bre Bachi Iyu Bachi a ye gra ri mo, nga me wo raan gbangban riwa a he ka rangan, a ran yi kugon won. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Iran a tre ri, &lt;&lt;Nghan kya riwa wu to, nga wu ri tru mbe hi no wa tra Izhi tamgban: Afisa nga Simirna, nga Birgamu nga Tiyatira, nga Sardis, nga Filadelfiya nga Lawudikiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Me kɨma gon me ri to ko a he ngaa nye ri tre ri me, nga me to konkron riwa wa ka wulu dzi ri tu wan riwa wa ti ri zinariya mgbɨre tamgban, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />nga rimi mba ikyari a he ka nji, a su tsro guglo riwa a ke riwu ri gbɨre dza, nga ran klo zinariya ri gbobre. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Nfu tu wan a he kinklan ka nfuzhuzhu, nga isi wan a ran rinzan ka iwulu; <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />idza wan a ran shan ka krefi riwa wa son ri wulu, nga iran wan ka ran glo ka ikɨbu ima. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />A ngizhi ntsen huwa tamgban ri wo ri wan, nga nji mgban ri nyu hari ka zhu ri nyu wan. isi wan ka kpan ka gbege zhi. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Riwa me to, me ku ri kusi wan ka ikɨmo. Ka yo wo wan ri kuwo ri ri mo ri tu ran tre ri, &lt;&lt;Ran ti sisiri ran! Ame mi he mimilan me ri he kremkpen. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Ame me he ri vri! Me ran kuu, ama zizan me he ri vri riwa a ran kre ran. Me he ri wulo nkon riwa kuu nga mgbumgblume ri kuu. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Zizan wu ngan, wa kyawa wawa bi to, ri wa kyawa wa zizan nga kyawa wawa wa he kusi. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Ingye nchi tu ntsen huwa tamgban riwa wu to ri kuwo ri won, nga tu nchi konkron ri dzi wulu tamgban: intsen huwa tamgban wa he miriko Izhi ri tra Izhi tamgban, nga konkron tamgban ri dzi wulu wa he Tra Izhi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Indu hi ri wa hu Izhi ri Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />Nghan hi ri vrenko Izhi ri tra Izhi ri Afisa ri: &lt;&lt;Rinyi nye he ndu riwa a zhu ri wo nji riwa a ngizhi ntsen huwa tamgban ri kuwo ri wan nga riwa a dzren rimi konkron ri dzi wulu ri zinariya tamgban. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Me to kya riwa wu ti; Me to bibi yaa riwa wu so rimi ndu nga vu sron riwa wu vu. Me to ri wu ran ri losron wawa wa ti meme ti ran nga wu tsra wawa wa tre ri wa he wa ndu Izhi ama wa ran he ran, nga wu to ri wa he wa che. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Wu he ri vu sron, wu so ya ritu won, nga wu ran chu sron wen zho ran. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Ama ingye bubu kughiren wen: wu ran nyime wen bibi riwa wu ran nyime wen ri mimilan ran. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Taka bibi joku riwa wu joku! Kima gon ti meme ti wen nga wuri ti kyawa wa mimilan. I wu ran ka meme ti wen chuwo ran, me ye ri wu me ri ye ban konkron ri dzi wulu-a ri bubu kri wan. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Ama ri nkon riwa wu ti tsra riwa wu kawen ri wa ndu Nikolatawa bibi riwa ame ngawen me kawon ri wa ngawen.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />&lt;&lt; I wu he ri ton, wu ka sren ton wu ri wo kya riwa Iyu tre ri wa tra Izhi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:7">&lt;&lt;Wawa wa ta ri me no wa gbengbren no wa ri klo konkron riwa ari vri riwa a gbron rimi zhu Izhi.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indu hi ri wa hu Izhi Simirna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />Nghan hi ri vrenko Izhi ri tra Izhi ri Simirina ri:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">&lt;&lt;Ingye nga indu riwa a zhu ri riwa wawu nye he mimilan ran he kremkpen, wawu riwa a kuu ran bru tashime. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Me to yaa riwa wu he rimi wan; Me to ka he ri kya riwa wu he rimi wan, ama wu he ri wo rimi wu. Me to kpa nde time riwa wawa wa tre ri wawa wa he wa nji Yahuda ama we ran he wawa ran; wa he wa shetan nye. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Ran ti sisiri yaa riwa bi so ran. Wo! shetan ri tsra yi ran vu wari mbi sro ri tra tren, nga iyaa mbi ri he ri vi wuru. Ti ndindi ti ri mo ko wari tre ri wa wuu yi, nga me no yi vri ka ife ri ndu ri tari. <verse eid="REV 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />&lt;&lt;Inji riwa a he ri ton, no wo kya riwa Iyu wa tre ri wa hu Izhi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:11">Wawa wa ta ri kuu ri hari a ran ri no wa yaa ngaran.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indu hi wa Hu Izhi ri Birgamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />Nghan hi ri vrenko Izhi riwa a he ri wa hu Izhi ri gbu Birgamu ri:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">&lt;&lt;Ingye nga ndu riwa a ngizhi nji mgban ri nyu hari riwa ari ri bran. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Me to bubu riwa wu son, ri bubu wan nye kpanchi meme nji he. Wu ran kawen ri kpanyime ri me ran, nga wu ran kawen ri yosron ri me ran kawu ri vi riwa Antifas riwa a la tre won ri kpunji, riwa wa wuu ri bubu riwa meme nji ri son. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Ama ingye nga wa vi meme ti wari wawa me fe wu ri wa: wari rimi mbi wa hu tre Balaam, riwa a tsro Balak bibi riwa a ngizhi wa nji Israila hi no wa ti meme ti, a hu wa ri wulu no wan ri ri riwa wa kadzi ri yibi nga wari kru ngamba. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Bibi wan nye me wari rimi mbi wa hu tsro riwa Nikolatawa. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Zizan wu ka meme ti wen chuwo! I wu kawen, a ran ban vi ran me ye ri wu me ri ti ku ri wa nji ri njimgban riwa a zhu ri nyu won ye. <verse eid="REV 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />&lt;&lt;I wu he ri ton, wuka wo kya riwa Iyu tre ri wa tra Izhi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:17">&lt;&lt;Ri wawa wa ta ri me no wari mba manaa rimi riwa wa ka ri. Nga me ri no ko nga rimi mba tita kinklan riwa wa ngan nde sisa ri tu wan riwa injo ran to ran ara wawa wa kpa tita.<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndu hi ri Tiyatira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />&lt;&lt;Nghan hi ri vrenko Izhi ri tra Izhi ri Tiyatira ri:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">&lt;&lt; Rinyi he ndu riwa a zhu ri vren Izhi, riwa isi wan ri rinzan ka iwulu, riwa idza wan ri kpan ka krefi riwa wa son ri wulu. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Me to kya riwa wu ti. Me to nyime wen, ndindi ti wen, indu wen, nga vu sron wen. Me to ri wu ti kyawa zizan han bibi riwa wu ran ti ri mimilan. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Ama ingye nga meme ti riwa me vu ri wu: wu vu sron ri waa riwa wa yo ri Yezebel mba, riwa ari yo ngawan ri nvra ndu Izhi. Itsro wan ri ngizhi wa ndu won he no wa ti meme ti ri kru ngamba, nga ri ri riwa wa ka dzi ri wa zhi wawa wa ran ri vri ran. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Me no vi ritu no ka meme ti wan chuwo, ama a ran ri wa ran ka dzren ntran wan chuwo ran. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Ngamba me ka wa rega ritu bla riwa wawu nga wawa wa kru ngamba-a wa so yaa bran bran. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Me wuu wawa wa hu ngawen, nga wa hu Izhi wawu wa to ri ame nye me to rimiren ko nga nga kya riwa ari wa ti. Me han konga rimi mbi ri bibi kya riwa a ti.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />&lt;&lt; Ama ngbron mbi ri Tiyatira wa kamba ri hu meme tsro-a; wa ran tsro yi kya riwa wa yo ri &lt;Inchon kya riri riwa meme nji.&lt;&lt;Me la yi ri me ran no yi kya riwa a han gbengbren mbi ngaran. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Ama tse me ye, bi ngizhi kya riwa bi he ri wu gbengben. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26-28" style="v" sid="REV 2:26-28" />Ri wawa wa ta ri, wari vu sron hi kre wan wari ti kya riwa me wa, me no wa bibi gbengbren riwa me kpa ri A ti won: Me no wa gbengbren ritu wa gbu, no wa ngizhi kpanchison mba ri kpala ri krefi nga me ri yira wa zhuzhu ka iri ntime. Nga me ri no wa ntsen huwa ri mbre.<verse eid="REV 2:26-28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />&lt;&lt;I wu he ri ton wu ka wo kya riwa Iyu la ri wa hu Izhi!<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Indu hi ri wa hu Izhi ri Sardis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />&lt;&lt;Ingan hi ri vren ko Izhi ri tra Izhi ri gbu Sardis ri:&gt;&gt;Itre nyi zhu ri wawu riwa a he ri wa wu tamgban riwa Izhi nga ntsen hwa tamgban. Me to kya riwa wu ti; Inji wa yonga wu he ri si yosron wen, ama wu kuu! <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Ri ngamba shime, nga wuri no kya riwa wu he ri wu senkpa ri ko no kuu wawu. Ritu me to ri ikya riwa wu ti a ran tsra kusi Izhi won ran. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Taka kya riwa wa tsro nga kya riwa wu wo; wuka hu wuri ka meme ti wen chuwo. I wu ran shime ran, me ye ri wu ka nji ri yibi, nga wu ran to vi riwa me ye ran. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Ama wari mbi tsawen ri gbu Sardis wa ka wa tsro mbi milan ki. Bi dzren ri me ri tsro kinklan, ritu bi tsra riwa no yi ti ngamba. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Wawa wa ta ri, wa suu bibi tsro kinklan nyi, nga me ran chu nde mba zho rimi mbe ri vri ran. Ri kusi Ti won nga miri ko wan Me la ri ra ri wa he wa mo. <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />&lt;&lt;I wu he ri ton, wuka srenton ri kya riwa Iyu ri la wa hu Izhi!<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indu hi ri wa hu Izhi ri Filadelfiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />&lt;&lt;Ingan mbe nyi ri hi ri vren ko Izhi ri tra Izhi ri gbu Filadelfiya: Imbe nyi zhu ri wawu riwa a he tsitsri nga ran he kpunji. A he ri wɨlo nkon ri kpanchison riwa Doda, nga ka a bu nkon, injo ran to ka ran, nga ka a ka injo ran to bu wu ran. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Me to kya riwa wu ti, me to ri wu he ri senkpa tsawen; wu hu tsro won nga wuri ran rii kya ri mo ran. Me bu nkon ri kusi wen, riwa injo ran to ka-u ran. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Womba! Wawa wa he wa shetan, wa tiche wamba wawa wa tre ri wawa wa he nji Yahuda ama wa tiche, me no wa ye kɨbu mgbazhu ri kusi wen. Wawu mba wa to ri me nyime wu.<verse eid="REV 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Ritu wu hu tre won nga vu sron riwa wu ti, me milan wu ya ri vi riwa iyaa riwa ari ye ri mgbumgblume ran tsra wa nji wawu. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Aran ban vi ran me ye. milan kya riwa bi he ri wu dzi, ritu no njo no ran vu-u kya riwa wu ta ri ra ran. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Me no wawa wa ta ri no wa he nju tra ri tra bre Izhi, nga wa ran ka-u chuwo ran. Me ngan nde Izhi won nga nde gbu riwa Izhi won, Urushelima ri sa, riwa ari zhu ri Izhi won. Nga me ngan inde won ri sa ri wa. <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />&lt;&lt;I wu he ri ton, wu ka sren ton ri kya riwa Iyu la wa hu Izhi!<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indu hi ri wa hu Izhi ri Lawudikya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />Nghan hi ri vren ko Izhi ri Lawudikya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">&lt;&lt;Ingye ngha indu riwa a zhu ri wawu riwa inde wan he Ami, wawu riwa a he ri ndindi ti nga la nyu ri kpunji, riwa a he kya ri kpunji riwa Izhi ti. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Me to kya riwa wu ti; Me to ri wu ran sii ran nga wu ran ti wulu ran. Wa ri tre ri wu he ri rimi mba! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Ama ritu wu ran he wulu ran wu ran he sii ran, me ju rega ri nyu won! <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Wu tre ri, &lt;Me he ri wo; Me he ri ko ngye riwa me wa.&gt;Ama wu ran to bibi yaa nga ilosron riwa a he ran! Wu he nji ri yaa, ri gbangbren, nga nfyen. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Me nghɨron, wuri ri re zinariya ri me, zinariya riwa wa sen-u ri wulu, ritu wu ri he ri wo. Ama ri tsro kinklan riwa wu suu ka gbre wen ri shan. Reh nye si yo ri si, ritu wu ri to tsu. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Me nghɨron nga no wawa me nyime wa yaa. son rimi kpunji, nga wu ri ka meme ti wen chuwo. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Srenton! Me kri ri nyu nkontra meri wuru nkon; i njo wo wen ran bu nkon, me gra rimi ko mba me ri ri ri ri wa, nga wawa wa ri ri ri me. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Wawa wa ta ri me no wa gbengbren no wa son kusan won ri kpanchi won, bibi riwa me ta ri nga zizan me kuson ri kusan A ti won ri kpanchi wan. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />&lt;&lt;I wu he ri ton, wuka sren ton ri kya riwa Iyu la wa hu Izhi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Igbre ri Shu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Kugon ri mba me bru rara ri meri to onkon ri ri hwo ri shu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:1">Ngha iran riwa a glo ka rangan , riwa me wo a ran tre ri, &lt;&lt;Hon ye ri nyi, nga me la-u kya riwa ari ti kugon rinyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Ri bubu wan Iyu ka gra ri mo. Kpanchi ri ka he ri shu riwa injo ka son ri tu wan. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Isi wan a ran kpan riri ka tita ri nkren, ka yasfa nga kaneliya, nga kagon kpanchi ri bubu wan gigran shinji ka zhu riwa a ran kpan ka tita zumurudus. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Kagon kpanchi riwa ngbron kpanchi sea don nza, riwa wa rinkon sea don nza wa son ri tu wan ri tsro kinklan nga tsro tu ri zinariya. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Inzan wulu ka ran zhu ri kpanchi, nga nzan ka ra yira. Ri kusi kpanchi, iwulu pitila tangban wa ran zhu, wawa wa Yuu Izhi tangban. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Ri kusi kpanchi ngawen, ikya ri a he ka inne ri glasi, a ran kpan mwenmwen ka iyu ri ya si ri zhi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Kagon kpanchi-a bla kungo wan, kyawa wa vri nza wa he ri bubu wan riwa wa he ri wulosi kagon kusi ri kugon. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Ri milan a he ka ichen; ri hari wan ka he ka nchon lando; ri tra wan ka ti si ka nji; nga ri nza wan ka he izhan ri kan ri shu. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Ko ritan rimi kyawa wa vri nza wa he ri mgban titanren, ri wulosi sho rimi nga ri ra. Wa sondu ran chuse bla mibre nga chu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">Tsitsri, tsitsri, tsitsri, a he Bachi Izhi ri mkpen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">riwa a he, riwa a he, nga riwa ari ye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Kyawa wa vri nza wa ran chuse ri gbre nga mkpen nga ngiri ri wawu riwa a son ri kpanchi, riwa ari son a ran kuu ran. Ka wa ti ngamba, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />wa rinkon sea don nza wa kɨbu ngbazhu ri kusi wawu riwa a son ri tu kpanchi-a, nga wari gbre wawu riwa ari son a ran kuu ran. Wa ka wa tsro tu ri mkpen ta sro ri kusi kpanchi wari tre ri,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />&lt;&lt;Bachi Izhi mbu! Wu he riwa wa no gbre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">ri mkpen, nga gbengbren.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Ritu wu ti ko ngye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">nga ri su wen wa he nga wari ri vri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Imbe Izhi nga Vren Ntima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Me to imbe riwa wa nye ri kuwo ri wawu riwa a son ri kpanchi; ingan a sho rimi ku nghima haha mba nga wa lo wu iyowo tamgban. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Ngha me to nchon vren ko Izhi, riwa a la ri ran gbangban ri, &lt;&lt;Inga he ri gbengbren ri sii kya riwa wa nyi ran bu mbe Izhi riwa wa lo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Ama injo a ran he ri shu ko ri meme ko ri mgbumgblume riwa ari to bu mbe Izhi ran dran ya mi wan ran. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Me yi bran ritu injo ran he riwa ari to bu mbe Izhi nyi ran dran ya ran. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Imba iri rimi wa rinkon ka tre mo ri, &lt;&lt; ran yi ran. Ya! Ichen ri gbu Yahuda, nchon gɨzhi Doda, a ta ri, nga ari to yira lo tamgban ran bu mbe Izhi riwa wa nye.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Nga me to ivren ntɨma a kri ri tsutsu kpanchi, ikya nza riwa wa vri waka kagon wan nga wa rinkon. Ivren ntɨma a kri zhu ka wa han. A he ri nju tamgban nga sii tamgban, riwa wa he wu Izhi tamgban riwa wa tindu ye ri mgbumgblume. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Ivren ntɨma-a ka hi ran ka kpa mbe Izhi riwa wa nye ri wo wawu riwa a son kusan wawu riwa a son ri kpanchison. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Riwa a kpa, kyawa wa vri nza nga wa rinkon se hari don nza waka kɨbu mgbazhu ri vren ntɨma. Ko ritan rimi mba a ngɨzhi ngungu nga tsustsu ri zinariya riwa a sho ri ima ri hwi raro riwa wawu nye a he bre wa hu Izhi. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Wa chuse sisa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">&lt;&lt;Wu he ri gbengbren riwa wu ban mbe Izhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">nga wuri bu mbe Izhi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">ritu wa wuu ri sen, nga ritu kuu wen ri sro yii wen, wu kpa wa nji chuwo ri Izhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">ri wa rɨme kankan, ri gɨzhi kankan, ri gbu kankan.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Wu kɨma wa ti kpanchison wa ndu Izhi no wa ti ndu ri Izhi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">nga wa ngɨzhi kpanchison ri mgbumgblume.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Me bru ya nganga, nga me ri wo raan miri ndu zhi riwa wa kigbu bran bran! Wa kuki ri kusan kpanchison, kyawa wa vri mgbɨre nza nga wa rinkon, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />nga wa ran chuse mgbamgban ri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">&lt;&lt; Ivren ntɨma riwa wa wuu a ke riwa ari kpa gbengbren, wa kyawa, wiwiri, nga senkpa, nkpen nga gbre!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Nga me wo ko ngye riwa Izhi ti wa ri shu, ri meme, nga ri ndodza meme, ri nne, wawu kyawa wa vri ri mgbumgblume nga wa ran chuse:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">&lt;&lt;Ri gbre nga mkpen nga gbengbren</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">wa he wa wawu riwa a son ri tu kpanchison nga riwa vren ntɨma hi riwa a ran kre ran!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Kyawa wa vri ti nza-a waka nyime ri, &lt;&lt;No he ngamba me!&gt;&gt;Nga wa rinkon waka kɨbu mgbazhu wa ri gbre.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Ikya riwa wa lo Tangban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Me to vren ntɨma a bu kya riwa wa lo ri mimilan ri mgbɨre tamgban riwa wa lo, nga me wo raan ri rimi kyawa wa vri ngbɨre nza riwa a glo ka inzan ri, &lt;&lt;Ye!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Me ya nga me to nghimaa kinklan. Inji riwa a hon nghima a ngizhi ta, nga wa noon tsro tu riwa chu. A zhu ka nji riwa a ta ri ritu a ta ri. <verse eid="REV 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Imba ivren ntɨma ka nghiren mbe; nga me wo kya ri vri ri hari wan ka tre ri, &lt;&lt;Ye!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Nghɨma ri nkan ri sren ka bru zhu. Wa no nji riwa a hon gbengbren riwa a ri ngizhi ku ye ri mgbumgblume, ritu no nji no wa wuu ngamba. Wa no nji mgban kigbu bran. <verse eid="REV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Imba ivren ntɨma ka nghiren kya riwa wa lo ri tra wan; nga me wo kya ri vri ri tra wan ka tre ri, &lt;&lt;Ye!&gt;&gt;Me ya, nga me to nghima ri shnji. Njio riwa a hon nghima-a ngɨzhi kya riwa wa tsra kpi ri wu ri wo. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Me wo kya riwa a glo ka iraan riwa a zhu ri wa kyawa wa vri mgbɨre nza, riwa wa tre ri, &lt;&lt;Nvangho wɨlo suu riwa a ri ke nkiren ndu ri vi riri, nga nvangho tra ri wɨlo bale riwa a ri tsra ri nkren riwa ivren ndu ri fe ri vi riri. Ama ran kpa wɨlo zaitun nga ima inabi time ran!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Imba ivren ntɨma a nghiren mbe ri nza; nga me wo kya ri vri ri nza wan ka tre,&lt;&lt;Ye!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Me ka ya, nga me ka to nghima riwa iima kpa wan a he ima vunvu. nde nji riwa a hon wu a he kuu, bubu son wawa wa kuu ka he kusan wan. Waka no wa gbengbren ri rimi ngbɨre nza ri ko ngye riwa a he ri mgbumgblume, ritu no wa wuu wa ri ku, ri yon, lilo nga wa nɨma ji. <verse eid="REV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Imba ivren ntɨma-a kla nghren mbe Izhi ri ton wan. Me ka to ndodza bubu bre wawa wa wuu wa-a ritu wa bla tre Izhi nga ritu la tre riwa wa la ri kpunji. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Wa kpagro mgbamgban ri, &lt;&lt;Bachi riwa a he ri gbengbren wawu, riwa a he ri tsitsri nga kpunji! Shitan nye ko wu bla tre ri wawa wa he ri mgbumgblume nyi nga wu ri no wa yaa ritu riwa wa wuu ta?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Waka no ko ngha rimi mba itsro kinklan, nga wa ri la wa ri no wa hi ki vri tsawen, tse wa wuu wa mgbron kpan ndu mba nga wa hu Izhi-a ri bibi riwa wa wuu wawa me ri. <verse eid="REV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Nga me to vren ntɨma-a ka bu mbe Izhi ri tanren. Inchon dzi tsu ka ye, nga izhi ka kɨma he shnji ka itsro shnji, nga ihuwa a kɨma sren ka iyii. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Intsen huwa waka hwen rega ri mgbumgblume, a he ka iwɨlo mbwa riwa inchon ngungu ri ti ka kpo wa rega. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Ishu wulu ka nye ngawan ka bibi riwa wa nye mbe, nga ko mgblu ritan mba bubu riwa iima kagon wan waka chiwi ka bubu riwa wa he don. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Imba wa chu wa mgbumgblume, wa ngizhi kpanchi nga wa rinkon wa klukpa, wawa wa he ri wo nga wawa wa he ri gbengbren, nga mgbron nji wawu, nga wa gran ri wawa wa ran he gran ran, waka ri ngamba ri nfron nga ri raan tita ri tu wa mgblu. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Waka la wa mgblu nga wa tita ri, &lt;&lt;Joku bi ri kɨshu ta ti no si nji riwa a son ri kpanchi nga ri fu vren ntɨma ran to ta ran! <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Inchon vi ri fu mba ye, nga ngha ri to kri kusi wan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Wa Nji Israila Ngo Gbigba ri ri Senza don Nza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Kugon rinyi Me to miri ko Izhi nza wa ki ri nde ri kungo nza ri mgbumgblume, wa ri ran raa ngungu mgbɨre nza no wa ran fu ri mgbumgblume ko ka ri ne ko ka ri ko konkron ri tan. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Nga me bru to vren ko Izhi ri a zhu kusi nzan ran hon shu ri mbe Izhi riwa ari vri ri wo. Ka yo wa miriko Izhi nza-a mgbamgban wawa Izhi a no wa gbengbren no wa kpa mgbumgblume nga ne. <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />Ivren ko Izhi-a ka tre ri,&lt;&lt;Ran no mgbumgblume, ne ko ka konkron ya ran, tse ki yo mkpan ri wa ndu Izhi ri mbe Izhi ri chi ri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Nga me wo ri wawa wa he ri nkpan ri mbe Izhi ri chi mba wa he 144,000. Wa zhu ri wa rɨme wuru don hari ri Israila, <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5-8" style="v" sid="REV 7:5-8" />ko rɨme ritan a he ri nji ngo wuru don hari: Wa he wa gɨzhi wa Yahuda, Ruben, Gad,Asha, Naftali, Manase, Simiyon, Lawi, Isaka, Zebulum, Yusufu, Benjami.<verse eid="REV 7:5-8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikabrutu jɨbu nji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Kugon rinyi Me ya, ijibu nji wa ka ki riwa njo a ran to bla wa ran! Wa zhu ri wa gbunji, ri wa gɨzhi, ri wa nkon ri wa rɨme, nga wa ki ri kusi kpanchi nga riwa vren ntɨma, wa su wa tsro kinklan nga wari ngizhi wa takpari ri wo mba. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Wa ka ndzu raan ri,&lt;&lt;Ikpachuwo zhu ri Izhi mbu ye, riwa a son ri tu kpanchi, nga zhu ri vren Ntima!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Imiri ko Izhi waka kuki ri kusan kpanchi, Wa rinkon, nga kyawa wa vri ti nza. Imba waka sontu gɨzhi ri kusi kpanchi-a nga gbre Izhi, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />wa ran tre ri,&lt;&lt;No he ngamba! Igbre, imkpen, wiwiri, ide ri ngiri, no he wa Izhi mbu hi riwa a ran kre ran! No he ngamba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Iri rimi wa rinkon-a ka miyen wen ri,&lt;&lt;Wawa wa su tsro kinklan mu wa he wa ngan nye, nga wa zhu kutan nye ye?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Me nyime wu ri,&lt;&lt;Me ran to ran, nji rinkon. Wu to.&gt;&gt; Ka tre mo ri, &lt;&lt;Wa nyi wa he nji wawa wa ye zhi ri nchon yaa ri si kpa ri. Wa ngla wa tsro mba wari no he kinklan ri yii vren ntɨma. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Ritu wan nye wa kukri ri kusan kpanchi Izhi wari ri ti ndu ri wu bla vi bla mbre ri tra ti baan wan. Wawu ri wa a he ri kpanchi ya wa no kya ran bre wa ran. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Iyon ko ila ima ran ti wa ngaran; izhi ran hu wa ran nga wa ran to lo kya ngaran, <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />ritu ivren ntɨma, riwa a he ri tsutsu kpanchison, ari he nji ri kshu wa, nga ari tsro wa nkon hi ri gba ima ri de vri. Naga Izhi ri se ima si zho ri wa ri si.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Ikya riwa wa lo ri Tamgban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Riwa ivren ntɨma a nghɨren mbe Izhi ri tamgban riwa wa nye, ishu wulu ka he yoon ri minti setra. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Imba me ka to miri ko Izhi tamgban riwa wa ki kusan Izhi, nga wa no wa rangan tamgban. <verse eid="REV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Inga ivren ko Izhi ri ka ye ri nvangho ri zinariya riwa wa gon ntsen ima ri mihwi raro ri wu ran ye kri ri kusi bubu ti ban. Wa noon ima ri mɨwi raro-a kigbu no sro ngha ri bre Izhi riwa wa tsitsri wa hu Izhi nga ran ka de ri kusi bubu tiban ri zinariya riwa a kri ri kusi Kpanchison. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Intsen ima ri mɨwi raro-a ka chu ban shi ri bre riwa wa hu Izhi-a ri wo vren ko Izhi riwa a kri kusi Izhi. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Imba ivren ko Izhi-a ka ban vangho ri gon ntsen, ran sro wulu sho ri mi wan ri kusi bubu bre Izhi, ran ka ta yo ri mgbumgblume. Inga inzan ka ran yira nga ran ran shan wulu inga dzi tsu.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rangan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Imba imiri ko Izhi tamgban ri rangan tangban waka milan ki riwa wa nviri rangan-a. <verse eid="REV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Ivren ko Izhi ri mimilan ka nviri rangan wan. Nzan wulu, kabru ri yii ka ran bwa ri ngbumgblume. Ishu ri tra ka gon wulu, nga wa konkron ri shu ri tra-a ri giga shushu waka gon wulu. <verse eid="REV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Ivren ko Izhi ri hari ka nviri rangan wan. Ikya ri riwa a he ka inchon ngblu riwa a ran ri wulu wa ka-u ta yo ri nne. Inne ri tra ka kɨma ti yii, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />ri tra rimi kyawa riwa Izhi ti riwa wa vri rimi nne ka kuu, nga nvu ima ri tra rimi mba ka time. <verse eid="REV 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Imba ivren ko Izhi ri tra ka nvri nkpuzhu wan. Igon wulu waka ran gon riwa a ran kpan ka inzan wulu ka zhu ri shu wulu ran ye ku ritu rimi nne ri tra-a nga ritu ndzi ima-a. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Nde ntsen hwa a he&lt;Ri&gt;Nne ri tra ka kma ri, nga ikpa nji wawa wa so ima-a waka hwa ritu ri wan. <verse eid="REV 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Imba ivren ko Izhi ri nza-a ka nvri rangan wan. Wa wuru zhi ri tra, nga huwa ri tra nga ntsen huwa ri tra, ritu no kpan mba no ran bran ran; ikpan wulu ri vi ri tra nga chu ri tra ngawen. <verse eid="REV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Imba me ka ya, me wo cheche riwa a ran kan ri shushu mu ran tre ri,&lt;&lt; Iya mbi! Iya mbi! Ari he ri se ri yi wawa bi son ri gbungblume ka iraan zhu ri rangan riwa ngbron miriko Izhi wa nvɨri!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Ivren ko Izhi ri ton ka nviri rangan wan. Me ka to ntsen huwa ka zhu ri shuwulu ran ye ku ri gbungblume, nga waka noo wɨlo nkon ri juju riwa a kyen ron. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Ntsen huwa ka bu juju riwa a kyenron, imba ntsen ka ka zhu kigbu ka a zhu rimi nchon kre; ntsen ka kma zhi nga ishu wulu ka kma ti bu. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Langblan waka zhu rimi ntsen-a ku ri gbungblume, nga waka no wa gbengbren bibi ri ri iran. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Waka la wa ri no wa ran no giga ri meme ko ka konkron ya ran; ara nji wawa wa ran he ri nkpan riwa Izhi ri chi mba ran. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Wa ran no langblan no wa wuu wa nji ran, ama wa no wa yaa ri huwa ton. Ilo ri yaa riwa wa no wa a he ka icho raan. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Rimi huwa ton nyi wa wa kuu ama nkon ran he ran; wa wa wari kuu, ama ikuu ri he kpata ri wa. <verse eid="REV 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Langblan wa he ka nghima riwa ka wa ki riwa wa hi ku ri wa; wa son wa son wa kyawa ri tu riwa a he ka ntan tu Chu ri zinariya, nga isi mba ka he ka riwa nji. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Nfu tu mba ka he ka riwa mbaa, nghiri mba ka he ka riwa chen. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Wa ka gbobre mba ri tsro riwa a he ka krefi, Iglo ri ngban mba a he ka ijibu nghima wawa wa tsutsu ri kya ri hon mba ri hi ri bubu ti ku. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Wa he ri jindo nga wari ran cho ka iran, Inga a he ri jindo mba-a nye wa he ri gbengbren ri no wa nji-a yaa ri huwa to. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Wa he ri Chu riwa wa he ri ndodza wan, wawu nye a he rinkon riwa juju riwa a kyen ron. inde wan ri nyu Ibraniyawa a he Abadon; nga ri nyu nji Helene a he Afoliyon &lt;&lt;Inji ri kpa tsu time&gt; &gt;. <verse eid="REV 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Iya ri mimilan ye vu yɨba; kugon rinyi iyaa hari wa he kusi ri. <verse eid="REV 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Imba ivren ko Izhi ri tanren ka nvri rangan wan. Me ka wo raan a zhu ri ku ngo nza ri bubu kri bla tre Izhi ri zinariya ri kusi Izhi. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Iraan ka tre ri vrenko Izhi ri tanren-a ri,&lt;&lt;Si miri ko Izhi nza wawa wa lo wa ri ri ba Yufiretis!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Waka sii miri ko Izhi nza wawa wa ka wa ki ritu vi, ri huwa, ri se riwa wa ka wa ki riwa wa wuu ri rimi gbu tra riwa nji. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Wa la wen lamba wa klukpa: ri wa he miliyon gbigba heri. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Rimi ya kusi won me to nghima nga wa hon wa: wa su tsro wa krefi riwa a sren ka wulu, ri ima vunvu ka safaya nga ima nchenko. Itu wa nghɨma wa he tu chen, nga iwulu ri nten nga nzan wa ran zhu ri nyu mba. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Iri rimi tra riwa nji wa wuu wa ri wulu, ri ntsen nga nzan riwa a zhu ri nyu wa nghima. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Gbengbren wa nghima a he ri nyu nga jindo mba nye. Jindo mba wa he ka manzɨrama nga tu mba, wa tindu ri wu nye wari ran no nji yaa. <verse eid="REV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Igbron wa nji wawa wa ran wuu wa ran wa ran ka wa kyawa wawa wa ti ri tu mba chuwo ran. Wa ran ka gbresan nde meme bɨzhi chuwo ran ko wa zhi mba ri zinariya, ri azurfa ri meme nga konkron riwa wa ran ri to ran, wa ran ri wo ko ka wa ari dzren ran. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Wa ran ka wuu nji chuwo ran, nga ti kyawa wa de sisri nga kru wa mba ri wa yɨbi mba.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Ivren ko Izhi nga Mbe Tsitsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Imba me ka to nchon vren ko Izhi ri nganga riwa a zhu ri shu wulu ran ye. wa nye ri kpa wulu nga gigran kagon tu wan; isi wan ka he ka zhi, nga idza wan ka he ka wa he ka igla ri nchi tra ri wulu. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />A ngɨzhi vi mbe riwa wa bu ri wo wan. A yo dza wan ri kuwo ri ri tu bane nga dza wan ri kuwota ri meme, <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />a yo ri raan ri bran riwa a glo ka idzran riwa chen. Kugon riwa a yo, inzan tamgban waka nyime ri raan gbangban. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Kugon riwa wa tre, me ran wa me ri nga. Ama me wo raan riwa a zhu ri shu ran tre ri, &lt;&lt;Ran bu tre riwa inzan tangban wa tre ran; ran nghaa dzi ran!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Imba me ka to vrenko Izhi riwa a kri ri tu ba nne nga ri raa ka ndzu wo wan ri kuwo ri ban shu <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />nga ran shizhi ri nde Izhi, riwa ari son hi ri kre vi, riwa a ti shu, ran ti meme, nga nne, nga kongye rimi mba. Ivren ko Izhi ka tre ri, &lt;&lt;Iwu vi ran he ngaran! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Ama riwa ivren ko Izhi ri tangban a vri rangan wan, imba nye Izhi ri nghran nchi kya riwa a kadzi, riwa a la wa ndu wan wa la tre ri kusi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Imba nye riwa me wo zhu ri shu ka la wen nganga ri,&lt;&lt;Hi wuri ban mbe riwa wa bu wu riwa a he ri wo vren ko Izhi riwa a kri ri tu ima nga meme-a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Nga me ka hi ri vrenko Izhi-a me ri myen ri no nowen vi mbe-a. Ka la wen ri, &lt;&lt;kpa wuri ka tan; a ri kɨma ri ri wu rimi ne, ama ri nyu wen a ri roo ka iton.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Me ka ban vi mbe-a ri wo wan me ri ka tan, nga ka roo ka iton ri nyu won. Ama kugon riwa me miyen wu, ka kɨma tingban rimo ri ne. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Imba waka la wen ri,&lt;&lt;Wu bru la tre Izhi nganga ritu kpanji, ri wa rɨme kigbu nga wa chu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Wa kpa nyu Hari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Wa no wen kpala riwa a he ka kpala ri tsra kpi, nga wa la wen ri, &lt;&lt;Hi wuri tsra bubu bre riwa Izhi nga bubu kri bla tre Izhi, nga wu ri bla wawa wa gbre Izhi ri bubu bre riwa Izhi. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Ama ran tsra raa ri bubu bre riwa Izhi ran, ritu wa ka no wawa wa ran to Izhi ran wawa wa no gbu ri tsitsri yaa ri huwa senza don hari. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Me ti wa kpa nyu won hari ndu wawa wa su tsro ri yii kuu, nga wa la tre Izhi ri vi Ngo ri ri gbigba hari ri se tanren.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Wa kpa nyu won hari wa he konkron zaitun hari nga wulu hari riwa wa he ri kusi Izhi riwa gbungblume wawu. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Injo wa ran sen wa, iwulu ka zhu ri nyu mba nga ran gon wawa wa he kusi ri wa; nga nji riwa a ri wa ran he kusi ri wa, wa wuu nji wan. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Wa he ri gbengbren riwa wa ka shuwulu riwa no wulu no ran ku ri vi riwa wa la tre Izhi ran. Wa he ri gbengbren ngawen ritu ima, wa ri kma wa ti yii; nga wa he ri gbengbren riwa wa ngɨzhi ko bibi ya ritan ye ri wa ri ko vi ritan riwa wa suu. <verse eid="REV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />I wa kre bla tre Izhi mba, meme nɨma ka zhu rimi juju ri wanyu ri wa, <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />nga wa kpa mba wa wa kru ri wiri nchon gbu, ri bubu riwa wa kpan Bachi mba ri tu konkron. nde gbu mba he Sodom ko ka Masar <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Wa nji wa gbu,igɨzhi, irɨme, wa ya wa kimo mba ri vi tra ri ngbron nga wa de nkon ri no wa yibi ran. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Wa nji gbungblume wa ngiri ritu ku nji hari. Wa ro nga wari no ngamba de, ritu wa la tre Izhi ri kusi hari-a wa ngɨzhi ya ye ri wawa wa he ri gbungblume. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Kugon vi tra ri ngbron ivri ri de son ka zhu ri Izhi ye ran gra ri wa, nga wa ka krinde; nga wawa wa to wa waka ti sisiri. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Imba wa la tre Zhi ri kusi waka wo ran ri shu ka tre wa ri, &lt;&lt;Hon ye ri nyi!&gt;&gt;Bibi riwa wa kpan fu mba wa ya, wa hi ri shu rimi kpa wulu. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Ri bubu wan idzi meme ri fu ka ye, iri rimi wuru ri gbu wa dzi wa, nga nji ngo tangban wa wu wa. Wa ngbron nji waka ti sisiri wari gbre gbengbren Izhi ri shu. <verse eid="REV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Iya ri mimilan vu yiba, ri hari wan gon ri ye!<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rangan Ri Tangban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Imba ivren ko Izhi ri tangban-a ka nvri rangan wan, nga iran ka zhu ri shu ye ri, &lt;&lt;Ngbengbɨren ri ngɨzhi gbungblume he wa Bachi nga nji ri kpa chuwo, nga a ri son ri kpanchi riwa a ran kre ran!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Nga wa rinkon se hari don nza waka son ri kpanchi mba ri kusi Izhi wa kɨbu ngbazhu wari gbre Izhi, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />nga wa ran tre ri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">&lt;&lt;Bachi Izhi ri gbengbren, wawu riwa a ran he nga riwa a he!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Ki ngiri wu riwa wu ban nchon gbengbren wen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">nga wu ri son ri kpanchi wen!<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Wa nji wa sho ri fu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ritu ivi fu wen ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ivi riwa wabla tre ri wawa wa ku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ivi ye riwa wa no wa la tre wen ri kusi ife ri ndu mba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">nga biyi wa nji mbi wawu, wawa wa noo nkpen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">wa ri bran nga wa tsitsa bibi ri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ivi ye riwa wa wu wawa wa kpa gbungblume time!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Waka bu bubu bre ri shu, nga waka to ikpo ri katredzi. Imba waka to ishan wulu, ishan nga yira nzan, nga yira meme, nga tita wulu.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Iwaa Nga Manzrama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Imba waka to kyari ri de sisiri ka zhu ri kpa wulu. Iwaa ri ka su itsro wan a he zhi nga manzɨrama ka he ri ndodza wan nga ntan tu riwa chu wuru don hari ri ntsen hua ri tu wan. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />A gon ran ngɨzhi, ilo nga yaa ri wa waa ri ngɨzhi ka noo yi zhu ngbangban. <verse eid="REV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Ikya ri de sisiri ka ran bru zhu ri kpa wulu. inchon manzɨrama ri ri sren ri tu tangban nga nju wuru nga ko tu ritan ka he ri ntan tu riwa chu. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Wa ka jindo mba gbi ntsen huwa ri tra rega ri ma. Ka kri ri kusi wa, ritu ran tan vren wa-a ka a ngzhu yo ra. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Imba ka ngɨzhi vren ron, riwa ari ngɨzhi kpanchison ri gbungblume wawu ri kpala krefi. Ama wa ban vren-a kado ngbzhi hi ri Izhi ri kpanchi wan. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Iwa ka tsutsu hi ri tsutsu ji, ri bubu riwa Izhi a milan ti dzi ri wu, ri bubu riwa wa ran ya ri vi ngo ri ri gbigba hari ri setanren(1,260.) <verse eid="REV 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Imba iku ka wulunde ri shu. Mikayel nga wa ngbɨron miri ko Izhi wawa wa he ri ndodza wan waka tiku ri manzɨrama, riwa wawu nga miri ko wan waka kɨma ti ku ri wa ngawen; <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />ama waka ta ri ri manzɨrama, nga wawu ri miri ko wan wa ran no wa son ri shu ngaran. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Waka dzu nchon manzɨrama ri sen-a zho, nde wan a he meme nji, ko shetan, riwa a gyuru gbungblume wawu. Waka ta yo ri gbungblume, nga wa miri ko wan ngawen. <verse eid="REV 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Imba ka wo ran gbangban ri shu ri, &lt;&lt;Zizan ikpachuwo wan Izhi a ye! Zizan nji ri kpachuwo a tsro gbengbren wan! Wawu riwa ari ngɨzhi tre wa hu Izhi he ri kusi Izhi bla vi bla mbre wa tru taga ri gbungblume. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Wa tari ri tu wan ri yii vren ntɨma nga ri kpunji riwa wa la; nga wa ran wa wari ka ngamba de ritu wari kuu. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Bi ti kinklan sron, biyi shu wulu, nga ko ngha riwa ari son rimi wan! Ama iyaa mbi gbungblume nga nne! Ritu ye ri yi ri meme, nga a sho ri fu ritu a to ri wawu he ri vi tsa wen riwa a ri son.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />I manzɨrama to ri wa wa tru dzu wawu ye ri meme, ari gra dzu waa riwa a ngɨzhi vren. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Wa noo piri ngban riwa ari kan hi ngawan ri tsutsu ji bubu riwa wa ran ya ri se tra ri ngbron, ritu kpaa chuwo ri wo manzɨrama no ran noon yaa ran. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Manzrama ka ju ima hu nyu wan bwa hu gon wa ritu no ban wu hi ngawan. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Ama meme ka dzon wa; ka miyen ima riwa a zhu ri nyu manzɨrama. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Manzrama ka ran ti fu ri wa-a ran hi ngawan ran wanyu ri wa ngbron gɨzhi wa-a, wawa wa hu tre Izhi nga wari ran ti ndindi ti ri kpunji riwa Yeso a nghɨran. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Nga Manzrama ka kri ri nyu nne.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Inɨma ji wari Hari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Imba me ka to nɨma ji rimi nne ka zhu rimi nne ran ye. a he ri nju wuru nga tu tangban; ko nju ritan a he ri ntantu chu nga ri tu mba wan nga nde riwa a he kra Izhi tu. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Inɨma a he ka ichen ri waa, nga idza wan ka zhu fu ka nɨma riwa a he ka yawu ri ji nga nyu wan ka he ka ichen roron. Manzɨrama ka ka gbengbren wan ka no nɨma rimi nne-a, kpanchison wan nga gbengbren wan. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Itu ri rimi mba a he ka a ti nchon njon riwa a wiri. Ka ndzu gbungblume wawu waka ran hu nɨma. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Ko ngha ka kɨbu ngbazhu ri manzɨrama ritu a ka gbengbren wan ka no nɨma rimi nne-a. Waka kɨbu ngbazhu ri nɨma rimi nne-a ngawen, wari ran tre ri, &lt;&lt;Inga he ka nɨma rimi nne-a? Ngha ri to kri ran wanyu ri wu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Waka noo nkon riwa a kpo ngawan ran kra Izhi tu, nga wa no kpanchison ri huwa senza don hari. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />A gra ri kra Izhi tu, inde wan, bubu riwa a ran son, nga wawa wa he ri shu wawu. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Wa noo no wanyu ri wa hu Izhi nga ran han gbengbren mba, nga wa no kpanchison ko meme ritan, rɨme nga ko wa ngha. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Ko nga riwa a ri son ri gbungblume wa kɨbu ngbazhu ri wu, ara wawa nde mba wa ngha wa ri ko wa ti gbungblume rimi mbe riwa wa vri riwa wa he wa vren ntɨma riwa wa wuu.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />&lt;&lt;Wo mba, i bi he ri ton! <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Inji riwa wa kadzi ri wa no yaa, wa no ya, nga nji riwa wa kadzi ri wa wuu ri nji ngba, ri nji ngban wa wuu, rinyi he riwa ki vu sron ri yosron ri ngbron wa hu Izhi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Imba me ka to meme nɨma ri nne ri, riwa a zhu ri gbungblume ye. A he ri nju tɨari ka riwa nren ntɨma, nga ran tre ka manzɨrama. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />A tindu ri gbengbren meme nɨma rimi nne ri mimilan ri zizan. A vu gbungblume nga wawa wa he ri mi wan no wa kɨbu ngbazhu ri meme nɨma rimi nne, riwa njon wan a wiri-a. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Meme nɨma ri mi nne ri hari a ti kyawa wa de sisiri; a no wulu zhu ri shu ye ri meme ri kusi ko ngha. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Nga ka gyuru wa nji wawa wa son ri gbungblume ri kyawa wa de sisiri riwa wa no ti ri kusi meme nɨma ri ma ri mimilan. A la wa ri no wa mme kponkpon ri ri nkpen riwa meme manzɨrama ri wa tibuu ri nji ngban ama ka ran kuu ran. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Meme nɨma ji ri hari wan Izhi a noo fu vri sro kponkpon riwa meme nɨma ji ri mimilan, bibi riwa kponkpon ri tre nga ran wuu wawa wa kamba ri kɨbu ngbazhu ri wu. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Meme nɨma ji ri hari ka no wa nji wawu, ri tsitsa ri wa rinko, wawa wa he ri wo nga wawa wa ran he ri wo ran, wa gran ri wawa wa ran he gran ran, no wa he ri nkpan ri kuwori mba ko ri chi mba. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Injo ran ri re kya ko ran ka re ran i a ran he ri nkpan ran, ari miyen nde meme nɨma rimi nne ko ka ibla riwa ari tre ritu nde wan.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Ikya nyi ri wa wiwiri. Inji riwa a he ri tu a ri to wa tu tre ri bla riwa meme nɨma ri nne nyi, ritu nde ri tre ritu nde njo nye. ahe ibla 666.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Ivren Ntima Nga wa Nji wan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Imba me ka ya, nga ivren ntɨma ka kri ri tu nchon ngblu ri Siyona; ri wu ri bubu riwa nji ngo gbigba ri ri senza don nza wawa wa nga nde wan nga nde Ti wan ri chi mba. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Nga me wo raan ri shu riwa a glo ka iraan gmo ima, a glo ka iyira nzan. A glo ka wa stsi kpi ro, wa tsi ngungu mba. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Inji 144,000 wa ki ri kusi kpanchi, kusi kyawa wa vri ti nza, nga wa rinkon; wa ran chu se sisa, riwa wawa kakre wa to tsro. Rimi nji wawu wawa nye wa he wawa wa kpa wa chuwo <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Wa he ronron wawa wa ka kpa mba dzi wa ran ka kpa mba kabru ri mbaa ran; wa ran to mba ran. wa hu vren ntɨma hi ko kutan riwa ari hi. Wa kpawa chuwo ri ri dzran riwa ngbron nji nga wa he wa mimilan wawa wa he wawa wa kawa no Izhi nga vren ntɨma. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Wa ran wo che ri nyu mba zari to ran; wa ran ti meme ti ran.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imiriko Izhi Tra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Imba me ka to vren ko Izhi ri ka ran kan ri shu, ri tre ri ro riwa a ran kre ran riwa ari la gbungblume, ri ko wa ngha, ri rɨme, ri nga gbu. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />A tre ri ran gbangban ri, &lt;&lt;No Izhi nkpen nga bi ri gbre nde wan! ritu ivi ye riwa ari bla tre ri nji wawu. kɨbu ngbazhu ri wu bi ri fe hi ri shu, nga ri gbungblume ri nne, nga ndzii ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Ivren ko Izhi ri hari wan ka hu gon ri mimilan, ran tre ri, &lt;&lt;A joku! Inchon gbu Babila joku! A no nji wawu no wa so ima ri ro wan, ima ri ro ri ntran riwa a senkpa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Ivren ko Izhi ri tra ka hu gon hari ran tre ri raan gbangban ri,&lt;&lt;Wawa wa kɨbu ngbazhi ri meme nɨma ri nne nga wu wan nga wari kpa nkpan wan ri chi mba ko ri wo mba <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />wawa kyumba wa so ima ri ro riwa Izhi, ima ri ro fu wan riwa a bwa sro ri gbengbren wan rimi vangho ri fu wan! Wawa wa ti rinyi wa no wa ya rimi wulu riwa ari mɨwi ri kusi miriko Izhi wa tsitsri nga vren ntɨma. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Ntsen wulu riwa ari no wa ya ri hi ri shu riwa a ran yi tu ran. Ikpa chuwo ran he ran ri wawa wa kɨbu ngbazhu ri meme nɨma rimi nne nga wu wan ran ko ri zhi ko ri chu ran, ko nga riwa a he ri nkpan ri nde wan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Rinyi he riwa wa nji Izhi wa vu sron, wawa wa hu doka Izhi nga wa ri ti kpunji ti Yeso. <verse eid="REV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Imba me wo raan zhu ri shu ye ri, &lt;&lt;Ngha rinyi: Zizan ban kusi ingiri ri he wa wawa wa ti ndu Bachi!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">&lt;&lt;Kpunji tre&gt;&gt; Iyu a tre ngamba. &lt;&lt;Wa ri ro ri ya ndu mba, ritu ife ri ndu mba hu wa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isren ri gbungblume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Imba me ya, nga me to kpa wulu kinklan, nga kyari ka son ri mi wan ka nji, ri ntan tu chu ri zinariya ri tu wan nga ri riji ri wo wan. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Imba ivren ko Izhi ri ka zhu ri bubu bre Izhi ran yi gbangban ri, &lt;&lt;Ti ndu ri riji wen wuri sren kpi, ritu ivi ye; gbungblume wiri riwa wa srenwu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Imba riwa a son ri kpa wulu-a ka son riji wan-a ri gbungblume, nga isren kpi ri gbungblume ka wiri. <verse eid="REV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Imba me ka to vren ko Izhi ri ka bru zhu ri kusi bubu bre Izhi ri shu ye, nga ka he ri riji riwa ari ri ngawen. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Imba Ivren ko Izhi ri, riwa wawu nye aran ya bubu wulu, a zhu ri bubu bre Izhi Izhi. A kpagro gbangban ri vren ko Izhi riwa a ngɨzhi riji-a ri, &lt;&lt;Ti ndu ri riji wen wu ri sren wa konkron inabi ri zhu inabi, ritu konkron inabi wa wiri-e!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Imba ivren ko Izhi-a ka son riji wan ri gbungblume, ran sren wɨlo ngru ri kpa wan, ran ka wa ta sro rimi juju bubu fu Izhi. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Waka shibi wɨlo ngru ri bubu riwa a he ri kugon gbu, iyi wan ka sondu ran zhu ri bubu wan, wa tsra glo wan riwa a ke mili gbigba hari nga iron wan ka he dza ton.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Imiri Ko Izhi Nga Yaa ri Kre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Imba me ka to kyari ri de sisiri ri shu wulu, a yikpa ran ran ndzu sron. Imiri ko Izhi tangban ri meme kyawa ngbɨre tangban, wawa wa he ri kre wan, ritu wa he tsro fu Izhi ri kremkpen. <verse eid="REV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Imba me ka to kya riwa a he ka nne ri glasi riwa wa san ri wulu. Nga me ta wawa wa ta ri ri meme nime ri ima nga wu wan nga wawa inde mba wa he wɨlo bla. Wa kuki ri nyu nne ri glasi, waka ka ngɨzhi ngungu riwa Izhi a no Wa <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />nga wa ran chuse Musa, nji ri ndu Izhi, nga riwa vren ntɨma: &lt;&lt;Nchon Bachi Izhi, ndu wen wa he wa rigra nga de sisiri! Ichu gbunji, nkon wen wa tsra wari he kpunji! <verse eid="REV 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Ingha nye ran ri ti sisiri wen ran, a wu Bachi? Inga nyeri kawan ri la ri wu he ri gbengbren ran? A wu nkshiwen wu he ri tsitsri. Igbu wawu wa ye kɨbu ngbazhu ri hu, ritu ndu wen ri dindi ko ngha ri too wawu.&lt;&lt; <verse eid="REV 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Kugon rinyi me to iko Izhi ri shu ka bu, ri bru ri tsitsri rimi wan. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Imiri ko Izhi tangban wawa wa he ri ya tangban waka zhu ri tra bubu bre Shi, waka su tsro ndindi riwa a ran kpan riri nga ntan ri lo wo ri azurfa nga ri gbobre mba. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Imba iri rimi ngbire nza ri kyawa riwa Izhi ti wa waka no wa miriko Izhi tangban ri vagho azurfa riwa a sho ri fu Izhi, riwa a ran ri kre ran. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Itra iko Izhi ka sho ri ntsen ri nkpen nga gbengbren riwa Izhi, nga injo ri ka ran to gra ri iko Izhi tse iya tangban riwa imiriko tangban ye ri kre wan.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Vagho ri Fu Izhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Imba me wo raan gbangban zhu ri iko Izhi ri miri ko Izhi tangban ri: &lt;&lt;Hi bi ri bwa vangho tangban ri fu Izhi ri gbungblume!&lt;&lt; <verse eid="REV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Ivren ko ri mimilan ka hi ran bwa vangho wan ri gbungblume. Meme njon waka zhu ri wawa wa he ri nkpan riwa meme nɨma rimi nne nga ri wawa wa kɨbu ngbazhu ri wu wan. <verse eid="REV 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Ivren ko ri hari wan ka bwa vangho wan ri nne. Ima ka kɨma ka yii riwa nji riwa a kuu, nga kongye riwa ari vri rimi ima ka kuu. <verse eid="REV 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Imba ri tra wan ka bwa wama ri yibo nga ba, nga ma ka kɨma ti yi. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Me wo ivren ko Izhi riwa wawu nye a he nji ri ya ima ka tre ri, &lt;&lt;Ibla tre wen riwa wu bla wa he kpunji, a wu ri Tsitsri, a wu riwa wu he nga wuran he! <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Wa bwa yii wa nji Izhi nga riwa wa la tre Izhi ri kusi, ingye nga zizan wu no wa yii no wa so. Wa fe kya riwa wa waa!&lt;&lt; <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Imba me ka wo raan zhu ri bubu kri bre Izhi ri, &lt;&lt;Bachi Izhi ri gbengbren wawu! Ibla tre wen he kpunji ran tsra!&lt;&lt; <verse eid="REV 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Nga ri nza wan ka bwa wama ri zhi, nga ka no nji wa gon wulu ri gbaji nzan wan. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Wa gon ri gbaji nzan wan. nga wa kra nde Izhi tu, riwa a he ri gbengbren ritu kyawa wanyi. Ama wa ran kɨma gon ti meme ti mba nga wari gbre nkpen wan ran. <verse eid="REV 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Ivren ko Izhi ri ton wan ka bwa wama ri kpanchi meme nɨma rimi nne-a. Ibuu ka ye ri kpanchison meme nɨma, nga nji waka tan nyiri ritu lo <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />nga wa kra Izhi ri shu tu ritu lo nga njon. Ama wa ran kɨma ti nkon meme ti mba ran. <verse eid="REV 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Ri tanren wan ka bwa wama ri nchon bane ri Yufiretis iba ne ka klu, ran bu nko ri wa chu wawa wa zhu ri kusi nzan. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Imba me ka to meme wu wawa wa zhu sran. Wa ran zhu ri nyu manzɨrama, ri nyu meme nɨma rimi nne, nga ri nyu wa la tre Izhi ri kusi ri che. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Wa he wu bɨzhi riwa wa ran ti kyawa wa de sisiri. Iyu tra wa zhu hi ri wa chu gbungblume wawu, wari ngɨzhi wa ye kabru ritu nchon vi ri bla tre riwa Izhi. <verse eid="REV 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />&lt;&lt;Wo! Me ye ka nji ri yibi! Ingiri ri he wa nji riwa a son ri si ran ya wa tsro wan, bibi riwa a ran zren ri ngbangbɨre ri shan ri jibu nji ran!&lt;&lt; <verse eid="REV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Imba wa wu waka ngɨzhi wa chu wawu ye kabru ri bubu riwa wa yoo ri Hibruniya ri Amagedon. <verse eid="REV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Imba ri tangban wan ka bwa wama ri gungu. Iraan gbangban ka zhu ri kpanchison ri bubu bre Izhi ri, &lt;&lt;A kre-e!&lt;&lt; <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Inzan ka ran shan wulu, iyira nzan, nga nchon yira meme. Wa ran to bibi yira meme ri bibi wan zari to ran tu riwa wa ti nji; rinyi nye he meme wan rimi mba wawu! <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Inchon gbu ka ga ti tra, nga waka zii wa chanchon gbu. Izhi ka taka gbu Babila ran no wa so rimi vangho ri nchon fu wan. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Kuklu wa bubu ri tsutsu ima wa shan kado nga wa ngblu wawu wa kado ngawen. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Chanchon tita wulu wawa iron mba a ke kilo seton, waka zhu ri shu ye ku ri tu nji, a no nji wa to meme ti Izhi ritu meme kya riwa a fe wa, ritu a he meme kya.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Nchon Wa Ntɨran Nga Meme Nɨma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Imba iri rimi ivren ko Izhi ri tangba riw a he ri vangho tangban ka ye ran tre mo ri,&lt;&lt;Ye, nga me la wu bibi riwa wu no intɨran yaa, nchon gbu riwa wa me ri kusan yibo kigbu. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Wa chu wa gbungblume wa ti ntɨran ri wu, nga wa nji gbungblume wawu wa huwa ri ima ri ro wan ri ntitranchi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Iyu Izhi ka ti ndu ri me, nga imiri ko Izhi waka ban wen hi ri tsutsu ji riwa konkron ko ima ran he ri bubu wan ran. Ri bubu wan meka to waa ri a son ri tu meme nɨma rimi nne-a riwa wa nga nde riwa a he kra Izhi tu kagon wan; meme nɨma a he ri tu tangban nga nju wuru. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Iwa a su tsro ri ima klo gbada nga ima ri sren, nga ran ka ngawan ri nghima tsro ri zinariya, ri tita ri kpan riri, nga wa kpi wa nkren. A ngɨzhi vangho ri wo riwa rimi wan wa kpi wa zuu nye wa sho rimi wan ritu ndu ntɨran wan. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Ri chi wan wa ngha nde riwa itu wan ri yayɨbi a he ri:&lt;&lt;Nchon gbu Babila, iyi wa ntɨran wawu nga kyawa wa shan ri gbungblume.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Nga me to iwa-a a ran hwa ri yii wa nji Izhi nga yii wawa wa wuu wa ritu wa hu tre Yeso. Riwa me to-u, a no wen mamaki. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />&lt;&lt;Ritu ngye nye wu ti mamaki?&gt;&gt;Ivren ko Izhi a miyen wen. &lt;&lt;Me la-u tu tre ri nde wa-a ri yayibi-a nga riwa meme nɨma rimi nne-a riwa a ban wu, meme nɨma ri tu tangban nga nju wuru. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Meme nime he ri si ri sen, ama ran he ngaran;ari hun ri juju riwa kyenron ye ri bubu riwa wa wuu. Wa nji wawa wa ran son ri gbungblume wawa inde mba wa ran nga wa ri ko wa ti gbungblume ran rimi mbe wa vri, ari no wa mamaki riwa wa ya meme nɨma. Aran he ri si; a ran he ngaran, ama ari bru zhu. <verse eid="REV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />&lt;&lt;Rinyi he riwa wiwiri nga to. Itu tangban he ngblu tangban, riwa ri tu wan nye iwa a kuson. Wa he chu tangban ngawen: <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />taton wa joku, iri ka kawan he ri kpanchi, nga iri wan ran ye rina; ka a ye, ari son ri kpanchi ri vi tsawen. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Nga meme nɨma riwa a ran he ri si, ama a ran he ri si ngaran, wawu kyuwan nye he chu ri tandra riwa a he ri rimi tangban nga a he ri nkon riwa wa wuu. <verse eid="REV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />&lt;&lt;Nju wuru riwa wu to wa he wa chu wawa wa ran son ri kpanchi zari to rina, ama wa no wa gbengbren ri son ri kpanchi wari he chu ri vi tsawen ri meme nɨma. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Wa chu wuru wanyi wa he ri rimiren riri, nga wa ka senkpa mba nga gbengbren mba no meme nɨma. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Wa tiku ri vren ntɨma, ama ivren ntɨma, ri wawa a zhu na yo wa, imba wawa wa hu ri kpunji wa han gbengbren mba, ritu a he Bachi riwa wa Bachi nga Ichu riwa wa chu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Ivren ko Izhi ka tre mo ri,&lt;&lt;Ima riwa wu to, riwa iwaa ntɨran a son ri tu wan, Wa he wa gbu, wa nji nga wa rɨme. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Wa nju wuru riwa wu to nga meme nɨma wa kamba ri waa ri ntran; wa vu kongye riwa a he ri wa nga wari si wu dzi ri gbengbren; wa tan nɨma wan wari gon ri wulu. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Ritu Izhi a ka dzi ri wa riwa wa ti kya riwa wawu kadzi riwa wa ran ti kyawa ri bubu ri nga wari no meme nɨma gbengbren riwa a ri ngɨzhi gbungblume tse itre Izhi a ye. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />&lt;&lt;Iwaa riwa wu to ri nchon gbu riwa wa chu wa gbungblume wa he ri ndodza wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Ijoku Gbu Babila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Kugon rinyi me to vren ko Izhi ri ka zhu ri shu ran ye ri meme. A he ri nchon gbengbren, igbre wan a shaan ri gbungblume wawu. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Ivren ko Izhi a yi gbangban ri: &gt;&gt;A joku! Nchon gbu Babila joku! Wa bɨzhi nga meme wu wa son ri wu zizan; Wa kyawa wa zhu nga wa shan ri wa chenchen wa son ri kpa wan. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Wa gbu wawu wa so ima ri ro wan ri senkpa ri ndu ntɨran wan. Ichu gbungblume a ti ndu ntɨran ri wu, nga wa re kpi wa gbungblume wa fe wo ritu bibi son ri ntɨran wan.&lt;&lt; <verse eid="REV 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Imba me bru wo raan ri zhu ri shu ye ri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">&lt;&lt;Zhu ye raa, biyi wa nji won! Zhu ri kpa wan!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">No meme ti wan no ran gban yi ngawen ran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">nga no yaa wan ngawen no ran gban yi ngawen ran!<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Ritu meme ti wan ka dzen ban shu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">nga Izhi taka ri meme ti wan.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Ti bibi kya riwa a ti ri yi ri wu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">han wu tinkpa hari ri kya riwa a ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">No vagho wan no sho ri ma riwa a senkpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">ka tinkpa hari ri bibi riwa a no yi.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Noo yaa nga lo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">ka nkpen ri ri ro riwa a no ngawan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Ritu a sondu ran la ngawan ri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">&lt;Ame me he chu nye ri kpanchison nyi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">Me ran he waa ri kɨbo ran,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">me ran ti shnji nsron ran!&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Ritu nganba, ri vi riri wa wa cho ri kya meme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">lilo, shnji sron nga yon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Nga wa gon wu ri wulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">ritu Bachi Izhi, riwa a bla tre ri wu, a he ri gbengbren.&lt;&lt;<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Ichu ri gbungblume riwa a ti ntɨran ri wu ari yii ima si ritu gbu i wa to ntsen wulu ri nzan wulu riwa a gon wu. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Wa kri kpata, ritu wa ti sisiri so bibi yaa riwa ari so. Wa tre ri, &lt;&lt;Iyaa wen! Inchon gbu Babila he ri se! Rimi vi tsawen wa no yaa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Wa re kpi wa gbungblume nga wen wa yii nga wari ti shnji sron ri wu, ritu njo ran ri re kpi mba ngaran; <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />injo ran ri re azurfa mba ngaran, ri zinariya, ri tita wa kpan riri, nga shuwa nga ri wa tsro mba ri lilin wa ndindi, wa tsro mba ri ima gbada, ri siliki nga wa tsro mba samban; wa konkron wa hwi raro nga wa kyawa wawa wa ti wa ri konkron wa ti nkren, nga wa kpi tagula, nga kpi ri krefi shinji, nga kpi ri tita ri kpan riri; <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />nga sinamon, nga kpi yaji, nga ri ntsen huwa rimi ri mumu alikama nga wɨlo alikama, ri lando nga ntɨma, nga wa yawo, ri wa nghima, nga ri wa gran nga ri wa vri wa nji. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Wa re kpi wa tre wu ri, &lt;&lt;Wawu kyawa riwa wu yo sron ri wu fe wa wa kado, nga ri wo wen ri kpi ado wen wa kado, nga wu ran fe wa ngaran!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Wa re kpi wawa wa he ri wo rimi richu mba ri nchon gbu, wa kri kpata, ritu wa ran ri wa wari so yaa ri wu ngawen ran. Wa yii wa ri ti shnji sron, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />ran tre ri, &lt;&lt;Iyaa wen! Inchon gbu nyi! riwa a ka ngawan ri tsro lilin ndindi, ri tsro ima samban, ran su wa kpi ri zinariya, nga tita wa ndindi nga wari ri kpan riri! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Nga ri awa riri wa wo wan wa kado!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Wa nvu ri ima wawu ri wawa wa ran tsro nji, nga wawa wa he rimi wan, wa nji wa ban vu ima wawu wawa wa fe wa kya mba rimi nne waka kri kpata, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />nga wari yii ritu riwa wa to ntsen ri nzan wulu riwa a ran gon:&lt;&lt;Wa ran fe nchon gbu ri riwa a ke ri nchon gbu nyi rina!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Wa bwa wuru ri tu mba, wa yii wari ti shnji sron, wari ran tre ri,&lt;&lt;Iyaa wen! Iyaa nchon gbu nyi! Igbu riwa wa nvu ima wawu wa fe wo mba ri tu wan! Ama rimi awa riri kongye ka time!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Ti kinklan sron ritu wan, biyi wawa bi he ri shu! Ti kinklan sron ritu wan, biyi wa tsitsri ri wa ndu Izhi nga wa la tre Izhi ri kusi!<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Imba inchon vren ko Izhi ri ka ban tita riwa a wuloga ka nɨran ran ka ta yo ri nne, ran tre ri, &lt;&lt;Nganyi nye wa ta nchon gbu Babila yoga nga wa ran too ngaran. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Wa ran bru wo tsi ngungu ri nne wen ngaran, wa chuse, ko wa nvɨri rangan ko ka wa nvɨri nkpuzhu. Wa ran bru to nji ri ndu ri wu ngaran. Wa ran bru wo raan tari ri kon ngaran. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Wa ran bru to kpan wulu riwa vren ntɨma ngaran; wa ran bru wo raan wa waa ri sa imba roon wan ngaran, Wa re kpi wen wa he wa to ndu bran ri gbungblume wawu, nga ri wa kyawa wen wawa wa de sisiri wuri gyuru wa nji wawa ri gbungblume!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Wa no gbu Babila ya ritu iyii wa la tre Izhi ri kusi nga wa nji Izhi wa fe wa ri gbu, iyii wawa wa wuu wa ri gbungblume.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Kugon rinyi me wo gro ka ikabrutu jibu nji ri shu, ran tre ri, &lt;&lt;Gbre Izhi! ikpachuwo, inkpen, nga gbengbren wa he wa Izhi mbu! <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Ibla tre wan he kpunji! A no waa ri ntɨran-a yaa riwa a kpa gbungblume ran time ri ntɨran wan. Izhi a no ya ritu a wuu wa ndu wan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Wa bru kpagro nganga ri, &lt;&lt;Gbre Izhi! Intsen ri nzan wulu riwa a gon nchon gbu ka hon hi ri shu hi riwa a ran kre ran!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Wa rinkon se hari don nza nga kyawa riwa Izhi a ti wa waka ku susi wari gbre Zhi, riwa a son ri kpanchi. Wa tre ri, &lt;&lt;No he ngamba! Gbre Izhi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iri ri Ro ri Gran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Imba iraan ka zhu ri kpanchi ye ri, &lt;&lt;Ki gbre Izhi mbu, wa ndu wan nga wa nji wan, wa rinkon nga wa tsitsa, wawa wa he ri sisiri wan ri sron!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Imba me wo ran riwa a he ka ijibu nji, ka iran gmo ima, ka iyira nzan. Me wo wa ran tre ri, Ki gbre Izhi! ritu Bachi mbu, Izhi riwa a he ri gbengbren, a he Chu! <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Ki ti kiklan sron ki ri ngiri; No ta ki gbre gbengbren wan! Ritu ivi gran riwa vren ntɨma-a ye, nga iwaa wan milan son ritu wan. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Izhi a no tsro lilin riwa a wansi ri no kpa su.&gt;&gt;(Itsro lilin a he ndu ndidndi riwa wa nji wa ti.) <verse eid="REV 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Imba ivren ko Izhi ka tre ri mo ri,&lt;&lt;Ngha ri nyi: Ingiri ri he wa wawa wa yo wa hi ri bubu riri ri ro riwa vren ntɨma&gt;&gt; Nga ivren ko Izhi tre nga ri, &lt;&lt;Wanyi nye wa he tre Izhi ri Kpunji.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Me kɨbu ngbazhu ri kusi wan me ri gbre wu, ama a tre ri mo ri,&lt;&lt;Ran ti ngamba ran! Me he vren ri ndu kita mbuu nga wa ngbron wa hu Izhi, wawa wa kri rimi kpunji riwa Yeso nghiran yo raa. Ki gbre Izhi!&gt;&gt; Ritu kpunji riwa Yeso nghiran wawu nye de gbengbren ri la tre ri kusi.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inji ri hon Nghima Kinklan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Imba me to shu wulu ka bu, nga me to nghima kinklan. Wa yonde nji riwa ari hon nghima ri nji riwa wa nghime wu nga kpunji; Rimi kpunji nye ari bla tre nga ran ti kuu riwu <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Isi wan ka he ka nzan wulu, nga ka son wa ntan tu riwa chu kigbu ri tu wan. Wa ngha nde ri kpa wan riwa wawu nkshiwan nye a to nde ko a he ngye nye. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Itsro riwa a sua he kpikpa yii. Ndeh wan a he&lt;&lt;Itre Izhi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Wa klukpa wa shu waka hu, wa hon wa nghima nga wari su tsro dindi lilin ri kinklan. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Nji ngban ri ka zhu ri nyu wan ye, riwa riwu nye ari han gbengbren wa gbu. ari son ri kpanchi ritu mba ri wo ri krefi, nga ari chan wa wɨlo inabi ri bubu shibi ritu fu Izhi. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Ri tsro wan nga ri ngban wan, wa ngan nde riwa a tre ri: &lt;&lt;Ichu wa chu nga Bachi wa Bachi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Imba me ka to vren ko Izhi riwa son Izhi. A kpagro ri raan gbangban ri wa chenchen wawa wa kan ri shi ri: &lt;&lt;Ye bi ri ye kabru ritu nchon ro riwa Izhi! <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />Ye tan nɨma wa chu, wa rinko wa klukpa anga wa klukpa, inɨma wa nghima nga nji wawa wa hon wa, inɨma wa nji wawu, wawa wa he gran nga wawa wa ren he gran ran, wa rinkon nga wa tsitsa!!!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Imba me ka to meme nɨma ri nga wa chu gbungblume nga wa klukpa mba wa kabru wa ri ti ku ri ri nji riwa a ran hon nghima-a nga wa klukpa wan. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Waka vu meme nɨma, wawu nga nji ri la tre ri kusi ri che riwa a ti kya ri de sisiri ri kusi wan. (A he ri kya ri de sisir nye riwa a gyuru wawa wa he ri inkpan riwa meme nɨma-a nga wawa wa kɨbu ngbazhu ri wu meme nɨma.) Meme nɨma nga nji ri la tre ri kusi ri che Izhi a vu wa haha mba ta sro ri wulu waka gon ri hwi wulu. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Izhi a wuu wa lokpa mba ri nji ngban riwa a zhu ri nyu wawu riwa a ran hon nghima; nga wa chenchen wa tan nɨma mba.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Ise Ngo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Imba me ka to vrenko Izhi ka zhu ri shu ran ye ri meme, ka ngɨzhi wɨlo nkon ri nchon juju nga nchon sraka ri wo. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Ka vu manzrama, manzɨrama risen riwa wawu nye he meme nji ko shetan ran loo ri sraka ri se ngo ri. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Ivren ko Izhi ka taa yo rimi nchon juju ran tren-u, ran ka juju bibi riwa a ran gyuru wa gbu ngaran tse ise ngo ri-a vu yɨba. kugon rinba wa si-u chuwo ri vi tsawen. <verse eid="REV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />imba me ka to wa kpanchison, nga wawa wa son ri tuwan wa no wa gbengbren riwa wa bla tre. nga me ka to ivri wawa wa ran wu wa ngawen ritu wa la kpunji riwa Yeso a nghran nga tre Izhi. Wa ran kɨbu ngbazhu ri meme nɨma-a ko iyu wa ran, ko ka no wa kpa nkpan riwa meme nɨma ri chi mba ko ri wo mba. W ye ri si wari son ri kpanchi ri se ngo. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />(Wa ngbron wawa wa ku wa ran ye ri si ngaran tse riwa ise ngo-a ka vuyɨba.) Rinyi nye a he itashime ri mimilan. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Kinklan sron ri ri he wa wawa wa he rimi tashima ri mimilan nyi. Iku ri hari ran ri he ri gbengbren ritu mba ran; wa he wa ndu Izhi nga riwa Kristo, nga wa son ri kpanchi ri wu ri se ngo.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ihan Gbengbren Shetan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Kugon se ngo ri ri vu yɨba, wa si shetan chuwo ri tra tren, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />nga ari hi ran gyuru wa gbu wawa wa shan kagon gbungblume, Gog nga Magog. Shetan ri ngɨzhi wa ye wawu ritu no wa wanyi ri wa, wa kigbu ka wulo meme ri nyu nne. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Wa shan kagon gbungblume nga wari kagon wa gbu wa nji wawa Izhi nyɨme wa. Ama iwulu a zhu ri shu ye gon wa. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Imba shetan riwa a gyuru wa, wa ka wu ta yo rimi nchon wulu riwa a ran rinzan, ri bubu riwa meme nɨma nga wa la tre Izhi ri kusi ri che wa gbuchi ta wa sro rimi wan; nga wa no wa yaa bla vi bla tre hi ri vi riwa a ran kre ran.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikre Bla Tre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Imba me to ncho kpanchison ri kinklan nga nji riwa a son ri tu wan. Ishu nga meme wa tsutsu kaa don nga wa ran to wa ngaran. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Nga me to wawa wa ku, chanchon wa tsitsa nga wa rinko, wa kukri ri kusi kpanchi. Wa bu wa mbe, nga waka bu mbe ri nga, imbe wawa wa vri. Wa bla tre ri wawa wa ku ritu bibi kya riwa wa ti, nga wa ri ngha wa dzi rimi wa mbe. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Nga nne ka de wawa wa ku rimi wan. i ku nga gbungblume riwa wawa wa ku ka de kyawa riwa wa ti ngawen. Nga wawa mba waka bla tre wa ri bibi kya riwa wa ti. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Imba waka ka wawa wa he ri gbungblume wawa wa ku ta sro rimi ncho wulu. (Nchon wulu nyi he ku ri hari.) <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Wawa wa ran nga nde mba ri mbe riwa wa vri ran waka ta wa sro rimi ncho wulu.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Ishu Sisa Nga Gbungblume Sisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Imba me ka to Ishu sisa nga gbungblume sisa. Ishu ri mimilan nga ri hari wan waka kado, nga nne ka kado. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Nga me to gbu ri Tsitsri, Urushalima ri sisa, ka zhu ri Izhi ri shu ran ye ri meme, mɨlan ti nga wuri son gben, ka iwa riwa wa gran mɨlan son ri gben roon wan. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Me wo raan gbangban zhu ri kpanchi ran ye ri: &lt;&lt;Zizan iti Zhi he ri wa nji , nga wawu ri son ri wa. Izhi kyuwan ri son ri wa, nga ari he Izhi mba. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Ari se ma si zho ri wa ri si wawu. Ikuu ran he ngaran, shnji sron, ko yi, ko lo ran he ngaran. kyawa wa kɨmo wa kado.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Imba Izhi riwa a son ri kpanchi ka tre ri, &lt;&lt;Nga zizan me no kongye no he sisa!&gt;&gt; Nga ran tre mo ri, &lt;&lt;Ngha rinyi, ritu itre nyi wa he kpunji nga bi nyime ri wu.&lt;&lt; <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Nga ran tre ri, &lt;&lt;A kre! Me he mimilan meri he krenkpen, me he gbuchi me ri he kre. Ko ngha riwa ila ma ti wu me no hwiri no so ri ma ri de vri a ran tse a han ran. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Wawa wa ta ri wa fe rinyi ri me: Me he Izhi mba, nga wawa wa he miri won. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Ama wawa wa ti sisiri, wawa wa ri kpi nji, wa ti kyawa wa shan, nga wa wu nji, ri wawa wa ti ya tsu, wawa wa hu Izhi ri nka, nga wa che wawu bubu riwa wa kadzi ri wa ri gon ka wulu nga nzan riwa a he ku ri hari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Urushelima ri Sa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Iri rimi miriko Izhi tangba riwa a he ri vangho tangba riwa a sho ri ya tangba ka ye ri me ran tre ri,&lt;&lt;Ye, nga me tsro yi wa sa, iwa vren ntɨma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Iyu a gra ri mo, nga ivren ko Izhi ka ban wen hi ri tu nchon ngblu. A tsro wen Urushelima, igbu ri Tsitsri, zhu ri Izhi ri shu ran ye me <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />a ran kpan ri nkpen Izhi. nchon gbu a kpan wan a he ka tita dindi, a he ka yaspa, a kpan ka iyu ri ya. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />nchon gbu ri kankan riwa a dzen, ri nko wuru don hari nga ri miri ko Izhi wuru don hari wawa nye wa he wa ya nko. Wa nga nde rɨme tangba riwa wa nji Israila ri kpa nko. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Nkon tra a he ri ko kungo ritan: itra ri kusi nzan, itra ri kugbo nga itra ri kushu nga itra ri kusi yawulu. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Wa mme ndo ri gbu ri tu tita ri nchi tra tangban riwa ri kpa wan wa nga nde wa ndu Izhi riwa vren ntɨma. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Ivren ko Izhi riwa a tre ri kpala ri tsra kpi ri zinariya riwa a ri tsra gbu, ri nko nga kankan wan. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Wa milan nju gbu mme, kahu ri ipiri ri glo wan. Vren ko Izhi a milan gbu tsra ri kpala ri tsra wan: A tsra ka he dza ngo wuru don hari, ipiri wan ri glo wan a he bibi riri. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Ivren ko Zhi ka tsra kankan, nga a he ndza gbigba hari ri wuru don tanren ri glo, bibi tsra riwa wa tsra wa ti. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Wa mme ndo ri Yaspa, nga igbu mba waka mme ri kpi Zinariya nga ran ri kpan ka iyu ri ya sii. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Tita ri nchi tra ri wa kankan ri gbu wa ti ri ko bibi ri tita ri pkan riri. Nchi tra ri riri ka he Yaspa, ri hari wan ka he Safaya nga ri tra wan ka he agat, ri nza wan ka he zumurudus, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />ri ton wan ka he Onis, ri tanre wan ka he kaneliya, ri tangba wan ka he kirisolat, ri tandra wan ka he beril, ri chu wa ka he tofas, ri wuru ka he dayimon, ri wuru don ri ka he yasin, ri wuru don hari ka he ametis. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Nko wuru don hari wa he shuwa; ko nko ritan wa ti ri shuwa wuru don hari; wa ti ko nko ritan ri shuwa ri. Wa ti wa wiri ri gbu ri zinariya kakre, ka ran kpan ka wu ri ya si. <verse eid="REV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Me ran to tra bre Izhi ri gbu ran, ritu itra bre Izhi mba he ncho Bachi Izhi nga vren ntɨma. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Nchon gbu ran ri wa zhi ko huwa ritu no kpan ri gbu ran, ritu nkpen Izhi ri kpan rimi wan, nga vren ntɨma he pitila ri gbu mba. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Wa nji wa gbungblume wa dzren rimi kpan wan, nga wa chu wa gbungblume wa ngɨzhi wa wo mba ye rimi wan. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Nkon ri gbu mba ri kri ri hwo zhakuu; wa ran ka wa ran, ritu ichu ran he ri bubu wan ran. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Wa ngɨzhi wo wan nga nkpen riwa wa gbu ye rimi gbu mba. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Ama ikya riwa a dzu ran ri gra ri gbu ran, ko ka njo riwa a ti kya ri shan ko a la che. Ari he wawa wa ngha nde mba rimi mbe wa vri riwa vren ntɨma nyen wa gra rimi gbu.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Ivrenko Izhi ka tsro wen ba ri ma ri vri, a kpan ka wu, nga ka zhu ri kpanchi Izhi nga vren ntɨma <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />nga ka ran gmo ri tsutsu wiri ri gbu. Konkron ri vri wa he ri ko kungo ritan ri ba riwa ari klo nkpa wuru don hari ri se, nkpa ri huwa; nga vunvu wan wa he den ri wa gbu. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Wa ran fe kya riwa Izhi la nyu ri wu rimi mba ran. Kpanchi Izhi nga wa vren ntɨma wa he ri gba, nga wa ndu wan wa ku nga zhu ri wu. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />wa to si wan, nga wa nga nde wan ri chi mba. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Ichu ran he ngaran, nga wa ran wa pitila ko ka ikpan zhi, ritu Bachi Izhi ri he kpan wuiu mba, nga wa he ka chu hi ri vi riwa a ran kre ran.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso Ri Ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Vren ko Izhi ka tre ri mo ri, &lt;&lt;Wa tre nyi wa he kpunji nga wu nyime wa. Nga Bachi Izhi, riwa a ka Wu wan no wa la tre wan ri kusi, a ti vren ko wan ndu no tsro wa ndu wan kya riwa a ti riwa a ran ban vi ran.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Yeso ka tre ri,&lt;&lt;Wo! Iye won ran ban vi ran! Dindi ti ri he wa wawa wa hu tre ri la tre wan ri kusi rimi mbe nyi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Ame Yohana, me wo meri to wa kyawa wa nyi. nga ka me wo me ri to wa kre, i me ku ri kusi vren ko Izhi riwa wawu la wen kyawa wanyi, nga me ran wa meri ku ngbazhu ri wu. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Ama a tre mo ri, &lt;&lt;Ran ku ngbazhu ri mo ran! Me he vren ndu ka a wu nga wa miri vayi wen wa la tre Izhi ri kusi nga wawu wawa wa hu tre rimi mbe nyi. Ku ngbazhu ri wu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Nga ran tre ri mo ri,&lt;&lt;Ran ka tre ri la tre ri kusi rimi mbe nyi dzi ri yayɨbi ran, ritu ivi ye hure riwa kyawa wanyi wa ye. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Nji riwa ari ti meme ti no sondu ran ti meme ti, nga nji riwa ari ti kya ri zu si no sondu ran ti; nji riwa ari ti dindi no sondu ran ti dindi, nga nji riwa a he tsitsri no sondu ran he tsitsri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Yeso ka tre ri,&lt;&lt; Wo! Iye won ran ban vi ran! Me ye ri ife ri ndu won, meri ka no kongha tsra ri kya riwa a ti. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Me he mimilan meri he krenkpen, gbuchi nga kre.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Dindi ti ri he wa wawa wa ngɨla tsro mba zhu nga wa fe nkon ri klo konkron ri vri nga wari gra hu nkon hi rimi ncho gbu. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Ama wawa wa he ri ra gbu wawa nye wa ti ndu ri zu, ri wawa wa ti ya tsu, ri wa ti ntɨran, ri wa wu nji, ri wawa wa hu Izhi riwa wa ran to ran, wawa wa ti che ri tre nga ti mba, <verse eid="REV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />&lt;&lt;Ame, Yeso, me tru vren ko won no ye la yi kya nyi ri tra Izhi. Ame me he nchi gɨzhi wa Doda; Ame me he kpan ri ntsen huwa ri mbre.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Iyu nga wa sa ka tre ri,&lt;&lt;Ye!&gt;&gt; Ko nga riwa a wo rinyi ari tre ngawen ri,&lt;&lt;Ye!&gt;&gt; Ye, ko nga riwa ila ma ri ti wu; kpa ma ri vri no he ka ide, ko nga riwa a wa.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikre wan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Ame, Yohana, me fen ton ko nga riwa a wo tre ri la tre ri kusi ri mbe nyi: ka njo yo kya nga rimi mba, Izhi ri sro ya nga rimi riwa a nga rimi mbe nyi. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Nga ka njo ban kya zho rimi mbe tre ri la tre ri kusi nyi, Izhi ri ban ga riwa mba rimi klo konkron ri vri nyi nga gbu ri Tsitsri, riwa wa la rimi mbe nyi.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Wawu riwa a sheda wa kyawa wanyi wawu ran tre ri, &lt;&lt;Kpunji tre nye iye wen ran ban vi ran!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">No he ngamba. Ye, Bachi Yeso!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />No dindi ti Bachi Yeso no he ri ko ngha.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>